    entry_points: "Governed recall, influence inspection, capability browse or detail, promotion or contraction explanation, projection rebuild, routing, Thoth answer, and maintenance rebuild.",
    reusable_steps: "Authorize disclosure before search; query settled memory; preserve influence links; derive capability standing from qualifying settlements and variation; expose recovery, reliability, regression, and burden; promote or contract only through policy; fall back to source records; rebuild views deterministically; use the same record for routing and explanation.",
