// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Interface surfaces
//
// Maturity here describes the surface, not the journey. An exercised route
// proves that the surface is driven by a test or execution record; it never
// proves that every journey it binds to is complete.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

